Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:12:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Clean up config and remove unused Gemini service module
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Delete backend/app/services/gemini.py: it was exported from the services
  package but never called; intelligence/insights.py is the live path.
- Add backend/.env.example and root .env.example so secrets never need
  to be guessed or pasted; document them in the README setup steps.
- Default API_BASE_URL to '' so the frontend calls same-origin /api and
  goes through the Vite dev proxy; VITE_API_URL still overrides it.
- Replace the stale 14.8 tCO2e/ha/yr "Tier-1/Tier-2" constant in
  src/config/app.ts with the backend's IPCC Tier 1 stock density
  (283.1 Mg C/ha, 44/12, ±18.3%).
- Set pytest testpaths=tests so a bare `pytest` in backend/ no longer
  collects scripts/test_change_api.py, which needs a running server.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016qVASsBsrqQku9QCpuELs9
