 test / predict)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New package backend/app/pipeline:
- metrics.py: pure-Python confusion-matrix metrics (OA, kappa, per-class
  producer's/user's accuracy, F1), grouped-area → hectares, minimum
  mapping unit, change summary, deterministic model version hash.
- gee_steps.py: thin Earth Engine wrappers — seasonal composite, CGMD
  reference labels (image-bands or collection layout), stable-pixel
  training labels with edge erosion, stratified sampling,
  smileRandomForest training (label + probability), confusion matrix
  against a held-out year, per-class area, MMU/confidence-filtered
  gain/loss/uncertain masks, asset export.
- runner.py: PipelineConfig (validated; test year may not be a training
  year), run_pipeline orchestration with an injectable fetch/steps
  boundary, JSON persistence under data/pipeline_results.

Also: scripts/run_gee_pipeline.py CLI (--dry-run works without
credentials), GEE_PRIVATE_KEY_JSON inline-key support in gee_client,
CGMD_* and PIPELINE_* settings, .env.example and docs updates, and 18
tests that exercise the maths and the orchestration without Earth
Engine.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
